    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A pair of heavy brass manifold cylinders mounted to an airship's stern or binding struts, tapped directly into the Khyber elemental containment matrix. A crew member stationed at the thrusters can spend 1 action once per round to engage an elemental burn.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Boost</strong> [one-action] (manipulate); <strong>Frequency</strong> once per round; <strong>Effect</strong> The cylinders vent pressurized elemental exhaust, granting the airship a +20-foot status bonus to its Fly Speed until the start of the operator's next turn. If the creature activating this station bears the <strong>Mark of Passage</strong>, the status bonus to Fly Speed increases to +40 feet instead.</p>"
